{"id":"vod_bf_44774","vodId":"44774","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"斩·赤红之瞳","name_cn":"斩·赤红之瞳","date":"2014-01-01","year":"2014","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230424-45/7d32f265f620336f883ca2c58f33e1ee.jpg"},"summary":"历经了千年的繁华，巍峨帝都早已从内部腐烂，拥有邪魔灵魂的统治者，正引领文明走向毁灭。为了解除村庄的困境，拥有绝赞剑术的少年塔兹米（齐藤壮马 配音）独闯帝都。此时帝都至高无上的皇帝还只是不谙世事的孩子，国家的实际操纵者大臣只手遮天，是帝都腐朽的根源。历经一波三折，塔兹米被曾经骗过自己的雷欧奈（浅川悠 配音）强行拉入一个神秘组织Night Raid。Night Raid是一支令帝都所有权贵富贾闻风丧胆的暗杀集团，他们是革命军下辖的秘密特殊部队，其最终目标是颠覆大臣的统治。在娜杰塔（水野理纱 配音）的领导下，赤瞳（雨宫天 配音）、雷欧奈等绝世高手云集其下。塔兹米的命运由此发生转折，而接二连三更大的纷争则将其引向未知的彼方……　　本片根据タカヒロ（原作）、田代哲也（原画）的漫画改编。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-04-29 23:13:04","playable":true,"episodeCount":24,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/zhanchihongzhitong/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/zhanchihongzhitong/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/zhanchihongzhitong/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/zhanchihongzhitong/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/zhanchihongzhitong/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/zhanchihongzhitong/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/zhanchihongzhitong/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/zhanchihongzhitong/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/zhanchihongzhitong/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/zhanchihongzhitong/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/zhanchihongzhitong/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/zhanchihongzhitong/第12集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/zhanc